    value: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/causalNLP/gt-harmbench"
    description: "Hugging Face Hub mirror of the release dataset"
keywords:
  - game theory
  - AI safety
  - benchmark
  - strategic reasoning
  - Nash equilibrium
  - social welfare
